OL,3,AReeves says UK's future should be
OL,4,Ainside the EU
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer Chancellor Rachel Reeves has
OL,7,Fargued the UK's future should be inside
OL,8,Fthe EU, and that Brexit has made the
OL,9,Fcountry "poorer, weaker and less
OL,10,Fsecure".
OL,12,FIn her first major intervention since
OL,13,Fleaving the Treasury, Reeves said she
OL,14,Fwelcomed debate around the UK's
OL,15,Frelationship with Europe.
OL,17,FAt the last election, Labour's
OL,18,Fmanifesto said a Labour government
OL,19,Fwould stay outside the EU and make
OL,20,FBrexit work.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
