OL,3,ACrypto firm Binance covers 90% of
OL,4,Alosses after $6.3bn hack
OL,5,
OL,6,FBinance, the world's largest
OL,7,Fcryptocurrency exchange, says it has
OL,8,Fcovered 90% of the $6.3bn (#4.7bn)
OL,9,Fassets stolen in a hack on Thursday.
OL,11,FThe remaining 10% may take longer to
OL,12,Fsource in the required amounts, the
OL,13,Fcompany added.
OL,15,FBinance has consistently pledged to
OL,16,Fcover 100% of the losses from what is
OL,17,Fsuspected to be crypto's biggest hack
OL,18,Fon record and said it has set aside
OL,19,Fmore than $6.34bn in company funds to
OL,20,Fdo so.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
